    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: speakerName
      value: Ihnat
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Hi Pablo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Let's go over the environmental objects
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: The spring helps you jump higher
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: The ladder helps you climb onto unreachable objects using W/S
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: You can also jump onto the bridge from below and jump off it using S+SPACE
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5].text
      value: "You\u2019ll also encounter various enemies with different mechanics,
        you can defeat them all by jumping on them"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6].text
      value: "Collect all the keys to open the doors, and don\u2019t forget about
        the flags"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7].text
      value: Good luck!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5611633731753175774, guid: 2f0b37f8e2294c059849443d2abea237, type: 3}
